                            </a>
                        </div>

                        <a href="https://github.com/Juandi01" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="spider-btn bg-white text-black font-mono font-extrabold text-sm px-5 py-3.5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-spider-yellow">
